# Prompt: Azure Cloud Log Intelligence & Multi-Agent Incident Analysis Pipeline

## Objective

Design and implement an enterprise-grade AI-powered log analysis pipeline for Azure infrastructure that collects, preprocesses, classifies, analyzes, and recommends resolutions for infrastructure errors generated by multiple Azure services.

The solution should be modular, scalable, production-ready, and capable of processing real Azure logs.

---

# Data Sources

The system will collect raw diagnostic logs from the following Azure services using Azure Service Principal authentication (Client ID, Tenant ID, Client Secret):

1. Azure Front Door
2. Azure Application Gateway
3. Azure API Management (APIM)

The log collector should retrieve only newly generated logs during every execution cycle.

